WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.990
<b>Twentieth Year of the Keichou Era, Osaka 
The Summer Campaign</b>

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.490
Otoshi! Where is Otoshi?!

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.580
Answer... Answer me!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.610
A woman!

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.100
There's another woman up here!

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.040
Impudent fools!

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.750
Don't you know who I am?

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.760
Otoshi?

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:43.730
Senhime-sama, are you all right?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.230
I'm fine. What of you, Otoshi?

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.880
Otoshi...

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.980
What are those clothes?

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.990
Who are you?

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:00.990
I am Namenba of Otoshi, an Iga ninja.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.010
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:41.590
Lord Tadanaga is nowhere to 
be found in his mansion.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:46.050
As we speak, my men are searching the 
Takasaki Castle region thoroughly.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.970
It's useless!

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:52.300
Most likely, Suruga-sama is in <i>there</i>.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:55.490
Tell Hadaebou immediately.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:03:02.030
<b><i>The Heavenly Robe Sees Carnage</i></b>

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:43.000
Those guys from Kishuu even brought cannons.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.580
Even Joujin won't last a second 
against that army.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.830
Perhaps nothing will be left for us to do.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.130
I don't know about that...

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.970
Please put your weapons away.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:05.300
Who's there?!

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.730
Namenba-dono, could you please ask them?

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.980
Sheesh... You again?

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.240
Someone you know?

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.080
We are actually quite close.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.740
Right, Namenba-dono?

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.620
You could say that... Maybe.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:37.630
So? What do you want?

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:43.560
I have come to ask you to 
capture the Murakumo.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.630
The Murakumo?

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:51.270
That castle on the other side 
of the Kinokawa River.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.240
You seem to know everything that's going on.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:00.270
But who are you?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.340
If you've come to ask us a favor,

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:07.410
why not tell us who you are, 
and then ask politely?

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:11.480
I'm sorry, Gorone-dono.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.160
My name is...

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.430
This is Hadaebou.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.170
One of Tenkai's dogs.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:18.670
Tenkai?

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.420
You've come to use us again, right?

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.870
Use you? Not at all.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:31.180
You also wish to defeat the Joujinshuu, yes?

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:37.880
And if Joujin isn't stopped,

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.490
a terrifying demon king will revive.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.070
And the civil wars will return.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.320
You mean Nobunaga?

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:48.070
So it seems.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.040
They plan to use a revived Lord Nobunaga

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:55.780
to turn this world into a living hell.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:00.570
This plan must be stopped.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:05.370
If you want to stop it so much, 
why not do it yourself?

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:10.080
We work behind the scenes and 
have no power of our own.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:13.110
We are far better suited to spying.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.540
We are willing to share

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.790
all of the information we've learned 
with the Iga and Kouga.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.330
You're willing to let others shed blood,

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:25.040
but wish to shed none of yours.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.990
Isn't that what you're really thinking?

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.690
Agreed.

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:33.770
Hadaebou, no matter what you say,

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.500
we will never be your pawns again.

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:41.000
Do you feel the same, Namenba-dono?

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:45.540
I see.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:49.630
It seems giving you some time 
to think would be best.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.750
I shall return.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.470
And when I do, I expect a favorable answer.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.070
As for today...

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.390
I shall be going.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:12.220
Looks like he's gone.

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:13.910
I don't like that guy.

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:19.310
Namenba, could you help me 
with repairs to the Ashura?

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:33.550
"Ashura" is one heck of a fancy name.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.600
That's the god who fought Taishakuten.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.290
What that guy...

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.560
What Hadaebou said...

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:46.300
That the civil wars would return?

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:48.730
I wouldn't mind.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:52.570
The ninjas would be needed again.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.340
Are you serious?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.780
It's what you wanted, too.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.420
Besides,

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:03.580
those of us who died must be avenged.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.590
Yes, but...

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:12.150
Nobunaga's going to come back, huh?

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.410
Is that true?

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:18.290
He died a long time ago. 
Why would he come back?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.350
Don't ask me...

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:25.760
Anyway, there's no sense in 
staring at each other here.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.610
Wait. Where are you going?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:31.720
The battle between Kishuu and 
the Murakumo will soon begin.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.910
I want to see who wins.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.190
I'll come, too.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:35.990
And me.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.830
You stay here with Hibiki, Rui.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:42.750
That Hadaebou guy might come back.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:45.320
Okay.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.370
My thoughts haven't changed.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:56.770
If they intend to drag you into 
some kind of insane battle,

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.130
I'll drive them off.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.020
Can I eat this?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.520
Hmm? Sure, I guess.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.150
Hey...

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.280
If you hang around the shop in that 
armor, customers will stay away!

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.500
Everyone's too busy watching the war.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.290
They won't come here, anyway.

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:10.080
Hey, samurai! Want to place 
a bet on the winner?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.880
I'm betting one shu on Kishuu.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.940
Same, but I'll bet two shu.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.340
I'll put one bun on Kishuu, too.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:18.910
Huh?

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.590
Samurai?

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:40.550
Th-They've brought barbarians' cannons!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.120
Don't worry, Suruga-sama.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:50.120
The Kishuu's cannons are mere toys.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.380
What?

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.170
Indeed...

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:57.090
Compared to the Murakumo's cannons.

00:10:57.810 --> 00:10:59.130
Cannons...

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.140
This mechanical castle has cannons?

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.050
Isn't... that enough?

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.480
That's enough...

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:47.490
<b>Seventeen Years Ago</b>

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:51.010
For generations, my family

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:55.060
has been tasked with saving nobility 
from castles as they fell.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:13:00.630
I have been waiting to save you, 
if you required it, Senhime-sama.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:03.500
I married into the Toyotomis.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.260
I am Hideyori-sama's wife.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.890
I cannot escape and abandon my husband!

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:13.140
Hideyori-sama and Ochacha no Kata-sama
have already committed seppuku.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.140
Look below.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.150
The battle is over.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:24.180
Anything beyond will be simple slaughter.

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:26.910
And only you can end it,

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:30.700
granddaughter of Tokugawa Ieyasu.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:34.270
No one but you can.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.360
Come.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:42.910
Let us go.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.930
Senhime-sama, don't let go!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:14.380
Is that...

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:22.890
A girl!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:23.710
There's a girl here!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.470
<b>Sakazaki Naomori</b>

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:27.540
Is that...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.520
Senhime-sama!

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.470
There's no mistake! It's Senhime-sama!

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:37.450
Someone, bring a litter!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.980
Senhime-sama is here!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.620
Is anyone here alive?

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:17.030
A celestial maiden...

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.450
She was so beautiful...

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:30.900
That white robe... was so bright.

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:39.140
I hope... she takes me, too.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.540
Beyond that blue sky...

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:50.330
Yeah, I'll take you there...

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:53.800
Beyond that blue sky.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.820
What do you think, Suruga-sama?

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:19.050
Absolutely astonishing...

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:23.580
With these cannons, Japan can be mine.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.110
What are you doing?

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.100
Can't you tell?

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.600
They're keeping everyone
waiting, while they play Go!

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:44.600
Both of you, why aren't 
you preparing for war?

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:46.860
I was waiting for you, Namenba.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.580
I made this, based on Utsutsu's drawings.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:59.620
So... The soldiers called the Rain 
surround this giant thing.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.370
And here's the plan.

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:06.980
Shichigen and Rui go around, to the 
back, to draw them away.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.540
Why am I naked?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.380
You know, it's pretty well-made.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.390
While they do,

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:22.390
Saizou, Utsutsu, and Shikibu take 
out the Murakumo's cannons.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.890
They'll throw explosives into the cannon ports.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.570
The Murakumo's structure

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.650
suggests that gunpowder 
is stored directly behind.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.310
If it works...

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:43.340
Ka-boom.

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:45.900
And me?

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:49.920
Stay in the village
and protect Hibiki with me.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:55.910
Namenba, you supervise the mission.

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:57.760
If there's a problem,

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.680
give the signal to retreat.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.180
Got it.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.970
Then it's settled.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:08.560
Even if we do succeed in 
drawing the Rain away,

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:14.700
if the Joujinshuu are inside, 
won't they try to attack?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.070
We don't know what kinds 
of techniques they'll use.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.970
True.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:23.780
Last time, you all almost died.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:32.590
The man outside can answer 
this for us, I'm sure.

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.470
Oh, dear... You saw me?

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.040
Who's there?

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.810
It's all right, Hachisu.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.230
Put the gun down.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:53.700
I am so very happy that you 
have decided to help us.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:59.740
I shall tell you all that I know 
about the Joujinshuu.

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:10.000
Let's hear what you have to 
say about their techniques.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:15.250
This looks absolutely nothing like me.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.760
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.010
We've received a report that the 
Kishuu armies were wiped out.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:24.400
Their army was supposed to be huge!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:27.330
They say that the enemy 
used powerful cannons.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:32.650
All the western daimyos loyal to the 
Toyotomis are preparing to rise up.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.600
And if the rumors are true,

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:38.250
the Sakai merchants are gathering 
huge amounts of money to lend them.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.850
Wh-What?

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:41.660
Calm down!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:43.910
Tenkai!

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:48.520
You must not be deceived by rumors.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:52.130
That is what the enemy desires.

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:55.420
Tenkai, do you have a plan?

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:59.550
I have sent a group of peerless ninjas.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:01.050
Ninjas?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:06.060
I am certain they will succeed.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.060
Simply await good news.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.820
Why did you change your mind?

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:27.830
I never want to go through that again.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:43.110
Hadaebou-dono, how goes it?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:47.510
Inform His Holiness Tenkai.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.570
The Kouga and Iga have agreed to help.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:54.780
The operation begins tomorrow, at 6:00 PM.

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:56.360
And one more thing...

00:20:57.010 --> 00:21:00.310
I know. I completely agree.

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:01.380
Yes, sir.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:04.990
If Tadanaga-sama cannot be saved...

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:09.250
His life is to be taken.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.230
That old man is a harsh master.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:39.700
You, hated by the Kurokuwa 
leader and driven out...

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:42.440
The time has come for you to be useful.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.030
Who's there?

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:47.420
Fulfill the task I give you,

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:50.910
and you will be free.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:29.960
Renouncing violence against all living 
beings, harming not a single one,

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:32.740
you would not wish for offspring.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:34.470
So how, then, for a companion?

00:23:34.980 --> 00:23:39.640
Wander alone, like a rhinoceros.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.480
<b><i>Like a Rhinoceros</i></b>
